
TY  - JOUR
T1  - Model-Based Systems Engineering in Space Applications: A Comprehensive Literature Review
AU  - Buruso, Rehobot Bekele
AU  - Himmiche, Sara
AU  - Tejumola, Taiwo
AU  - Alemayehu, Yeshirun
AU  - Rose, Bertrand
